{"id":"330e2dbf7702faae","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-blakers-massey.md","title":"Blakers–Massey Theorem","display":"thm-blakers-massey — Blakers–Massey Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-blakers-massey","aliases":["58-thm-blakers-massey"],"display":"thm-blakers-massey — Blakers–Massey Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-pushout.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-blakers-massey"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-blakers-massey</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-blakers-massey — Blakers–Massey Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c043773cb49e8df\" href=\"?note=3c043773cb49e8df\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pushout.md\">../batch12/58-df-pushout.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\begin{smallmatrix}A&amp;\\xrightarrow{i}&amp;B\\\\ {\\scriptstyle j}\\downarrow&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\ C&amp;\\longrightarrow&amp;D\\end{smallmatrix}\">\\(\\begin{smallmatrix}A&amp;\\xrightarrow{i}&amp;B\\\\ {\\scriptstyle j}\\downarrow&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\ C&amp;\\longrightarrow&amp;D\\end{smallmatrix}\\)</span> (homotopy-pushout square of pointed spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conn}(f)\\geq q\">\\(\\operatorname{conn}(f)\\geq q\\)</span> (the map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>-connected)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\times_D^h C\">\\(B\\times_D^h C\\)</span> (homotopy pullback)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC\">\\(\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC\\)</span> (canonical comparison map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blakers\\text{-}massey}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HomotopyPushout}(A\\xrightarrow{i}B,\\,\nA\\xrightarrow{j}C;\\,D)\n\\land m,n\\geq1\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(i)\\geq m\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(j)\\geq n\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{conn}\\bigl(\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC\\bigr)\n\\geq m+n-1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blakers\\text{-}massey}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HomotopyPushout}(A\\xrightarrow{i}B,\\,\nA\\xrightarrow{j}C;\\,D)\n\\land m,n\\geq1\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(i)\\geq m\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(j)\\geq n\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{conn}\\bigl(\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC\\bigr)\n\\geq m+n-1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, the homotopy-pushout square is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m+n-1)\">\\((m+n-1)\\)</span>-cartesian.</li>\n<li>Freudenthal is obtained from a suitable pushout square: the suspension map\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_q(X)\\to\\pi_{q+1}(\\Sigma X)\">\\(\\pi_q(X)\\to\\pi_{q+1}(\\Sigma X)\\)</span> is an isomorphism in its connectivity-dependent stable range.</li>\n<li>Higher Blakers–Massey theorems give analogous estimates for strongly cocartesian cubes.</li>\n<li>Homotopy pushouts, homotopy pullbacks, and connectivity are used here as standard metatheoretic constructions on pointed spaces; the earlier object-level turnstile incorrectly suggested that the cited atoms supplied predicates for all three.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pushout.md","status":"resolved","id":"3c043773cb49e8df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-pushout.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\begin{smallmatrix}A&\\xrightarrow{i}&B\\\\ {\\scriptstyle j}\\downarrow&&\\downarrow\\\\ C&\\longrightarrow&D\\end{smallmatrix}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conn}(f)\\geq q","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"B\\times_D^h C","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blakers\\text{-}massey}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HomotopyPushout}(A\\xrightarrow{i}B,\\,\nA\\xrightarrow{j}C;\\,D)\n\\land m,n\\geq1\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(i)\\geq m\n\\land\\operatorname{conn}(j)\\geq n\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{conn}\\bigl(\\eta:A\\to B\\times_D^hC\\bigr)\n\\geq m+n-1","display":true},{"tex":"(m+n-1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_q(X)\\to\\pi_{q+1}(\\Sigma X)","display":false}],"bytes":1645,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4047","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-blakers-massey.md|58-thm-blakers-massey]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["cc1ce993dd3ce56d","c682c089b3ac3182","3c043773cb49e8df"]}